stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> NoFeedback: existing or new job
 NoFeedback --> NoFeedback: active job refuses feedback
 NoFeedback --> PlannerAsserted: terminal job commits first assertion
 PlannerAsserted --> PlannerAsserted: same ID exact replay returns receipt
 PlannerAsserted --> PlannerAsserted: new ID appends correction
 PlannerAsserted --> PlannerAsserted: reused ID different payload refuses
 note right of PlannerAsserted
 Native job state remains unchanged.
 Assertions never become independent verification.
 Every correction retains earlier rows.
 end note
